   "id": "l0",
   "title": "L0 \u00b7 System context",
   "description": "System context: the machine manager is one box. The control plane and humans + mmctl call it; it drives the bare-metal providers, boots and audits the machines, which pull their boot image from S3, and it alerts in Slack. Nothing inside is shown yet, so L1 opens it."
